                    <p>• Payment & Billing:</p>
                    <p>• Payment instrument tokenized identifiers (we do not store full card </p>
                    <p>numbers except as allowed by third-party payment processors), billing </p>
                    <p>address, transaction identifiers.</p>
                    <p>• Device & Technical:</p>
                    <p>• Device identifiers, operating system, browser type, IP address, app version, </p>
                    <p>crash logs, usage analytics, cookies and similar technologies.</p>
                    <p>• Communications:</p>
