                    <h2>4. LEGAL BASES FOR PROCESSING (RA 10173 ALIGNMENT)</h2>
                    <p>• Contractual Necessity: Processing necessary to perform the contract between you </p>
                    <p>and SwiftX (order processing, delivery coordination, payment).</p>
                    <p>• Legal Obligation: Processing necessary to comply with legal obligations (tax </p>
